{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-15_end","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-15","title":"堅城高牆","storyCode":"10-17","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"6fdc891e0f63dfcc707f5bcda7c3fdef732b47fbe426d5753f6d0ac65a203194","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"12-end"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們已經不剩下幾個人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在以往的戰場上，想要拖住我，維多利亞至少要出動兩個以上的蒸汽騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再看看你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們只是一群普通的士兵而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——保持陣型！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盾還有能量的，跟我站在一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊手，保持火力輸出，牽制敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，號角！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過——他再強，也只是一個肉體凡軀的薩卡茲感染者而已，他的源石技藝會有極限！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想等法術消耗我的身體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們根本活不到讓我力竭的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布萊克！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，接著我的劍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在倒下的時候，他們向你投去的目光中，竟然還帶著希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的光芒，我以為不會在倫蒂尼姆再見到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這微弱的光亮，還能持續多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......從這裡倒下去的話......不過就是......回到......回到......回到倫蒂尼姆的土地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一次性把剩下的彈藥全部打了出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹得不錯。你第一次讓我停下了腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在這之後，你已經無計可施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在看到同伴們一個個死去之後，你也喪失鬥志了嗎，白狼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲......只要你們占著我們的城市一天，我就始終有戰鬥的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在想要打倒你這一點上，我和每一個維多利亞人一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的盾沒什麼用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這把劍......呵，也只是一把普通的劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿著這樣的劍就想與我戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......不要小瞧它，也不要小瞧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你惦記著的......蒸汽騎士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在脫下維多利亞為他們打造的甲胄以後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也只是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g5_giantwall_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們居然......進來了？這牆為什麼變得這麼軟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯啊，剛剛那個瞬間，我還以為我的腦袋會在倫蒂尼姆的城牆上開花啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是Misery的源石技藝，他不會讓你受傷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......凱爾希跟我說，你的大腦是羅德島的重要資產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手也不便宜啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了這一趟，我再也不找著要搭你便車了......蹭你的源石技藝，還不如讓煌抱著我蹦來蹦去更舒服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說是不是啊，博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的手沒停止幹活，說明還行。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"被煌提著也舒服不到哪裡去。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Misery最好休息一會。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，Misery，我看得很清楚......曼弗雷德那一劍，差點就刺中你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是他無可奈何下的一擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"你成功挑起了他的怒火，這讓他忽視了我的靠近。我還以為我騙不了他第二次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不是有意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當他質問我的時候，我確實感到了他的憤怒。那怒火是衝我而來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"如果曼弗雷德用上全力，靠他們幾個人，拖不了多久。我最好......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Misery，我知道你想去幫那位維多利亞軍官，但像今天這樣連續使用大規模的物質轉換源石技藝，對你的身體損耗太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"......放心吧，阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"我一時半會還死不掉。而且，我答應了凱爾希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些精英幹員......答應凱爾希醫生的事還少嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給自己注射應急藥劑。倫蒂尼姆的戰鬥才剛剛開始，我不想再發現你跑到沒人看得見的地方，把幾乎吐出來的血一口一口地咽下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，有敵人過來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，攔住他們！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"費斯特，給我綁六根滑索。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希爾，我們去裝炸彈。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，Misery幫我們找到了倫蒂尼姆城防系統的弱點......我們必須毀掉這間控制室。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速度很快——白狼，這才是你的本來面目嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣兇猛的尖牙與利爪，卻被維多利亞的貴族禮儀馴化......這真的值得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩卡茲，你此刻的樣貌，難道不曾被所謂的文明包裝過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說你們以前可不是這副模樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使你拼盡全力，也依然殺不死我。只要城防系統依然在運轉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等，白狼，你也只是想拖住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——你和羅德島的人又一次合作了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他們是誰嗎？你知不知道那個領頭的卡特斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我只知道，他們能阻止你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白狼，萬一今天你們真的能成功......那你會親眼看見倫蒂尼姆的高牆塌下一角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你想見到的嗎？永不陷落的倫蒂尼姆，可能從此神話不再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......從此嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你能站在這裡，那麼......倫蒂尼姆的未曾陷落，就僅僅只是一個自欺的笑話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！要是讓外面那些大公爵注意到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？你的臉上終於出現了一絲驚慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就說明我的決定是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如這面高牆......存在的意義僅僅是擋住城內維多利亞人的慘叫，那它早就失去了最初的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就該讓那些大公爵聽一聽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽一聽......我們的同胞是如何在你們的屠戮下哭嚎的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們還有多久能出去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......這通道是不是快完全塌了......我們會不會都死在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別看腳下，也別回頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在害怕的話，看看前面的路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信號燈還亮著。這是我們的戰士為我們點亮的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等那點燈光慢慢變亮......我們就能重新看見倫蒂尼姆的日光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的火力太強了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，我們根本無法靠近列車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮轟也還沒有停下來......下面的人還堅持得住嗎？我們還有多少時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官他們也沒了消息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我相信我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是支撐我走到這裡的唯一理由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，怎麼都甩不掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他剛才的速度你們都看見了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他像故意放慢了腳步，硬是......硬是看我們逃了這麼久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼變態啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......聽聽你們的呼吸聲與心跳聲。你們終於跑累了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......薩卡茲的榮耀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這根本稱不上一場戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我有些誤解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然“魔王”不在，那麼這裡就根本沒有與我匹配的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會與一群肉獸談論榮耀嗎？在你明知道狩獵它們只能帶來一些感官刺激，最終它們只配作為一道前菜出現在晚餐飯桌上的前提下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我們......當成獵物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便你是薩卡茲，這種為了個人喜好而大肆殺戮的行徑，也未免太野蠻了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以你們所理解的文明揣度我。這對我而言是最可怕的誣衊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在骯髒的瓦礫把你們砸成肉末之前，試著反抗我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會借由你們的鮮血記錄你們臨死前的思緒......所有的恐懼，不甘，憤怒......讓它們盡情地湧向我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，快過來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，你也退下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要擋在我們所有人面前，與他對抗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是他的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你會被他瞬間撕碎，血肉變成這管道裡最不起眼的一攤汙跡，你也不準備轉身逃走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......你們能跑得比我快一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不為什麼。我只是想這樣做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們頭頂的城市朝我們倒下來的那一刻，我想做最先擁抱它的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話......"},{"type":"narration","text":"管道裡的信號燈似乎亮了一些。\n是眼花嗎？為什麼倫蒂尼姆的地下會有星光？不......即使是在地面上，他們也有多久沒有見到陰雲背後的星星了？\n推進之王眨了眨眼睛。\n她忽然明白過來，那根本不是什麼星辰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一個按鈕。\n原本覆於其上的污泥被震落了，現在那個按鈕正在發光，而她恰好知道那是做什麼的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三歲那年，她第一次被帶到王宮地下。\n她的老師馱著她，用巨掌引著她按下了這個按鈕。\n倫蒂尼姆的地下空間伸展著自己的筋骨，朝未來的王露出了自己生機勃勃的血管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"二十多年後——\n她第二次見到了它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g5_giantwall_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有節點上的炸彈都安裝好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我準備好撤退了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，快來這裡，阻止他們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！糟了，他們人怎麼來得越來越多......是不是Misery去晚了，他們沒拖住曼弗雷德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來攔住他們，你們先走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，把引爆器給我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我得控制住這些敵人，你們才有撤退的機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你們成功撤離，我馬上就引爆這間控制室——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們不能再等了，無論是自救軍的戰士、維多利亞的士兵，還是海蒂小姐與推進之王小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有每一個正在遭受炮轟的維多利亞人，大家都等不了了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米婭，抓住我的手。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"告訴我，什麼時候按下引爆的按鈕。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......鋪天蓋地的黑色線條......什麼都看不見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，您為什麼......要擋在我面前？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經......已經不是那個脆弱的小孩子了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會再拖博士的後腿。我能抵擋住這些法術和烈焰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......撈到你們了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，原來你讓我提前掛在你腰上的六根滑索是這時候用的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然會行動不便吧......算了，反正你平時也跑不了多快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機，起飛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，驚不驚喜？為了回應你的需求，我終於給無人機開發出了——拉人滑翔功能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然續航能力有限，但至少夠我們安全落地——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是時候讓爆炸來得更猛烈一些了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制室——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......做到了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你早就沒有力氣了？你甚至都沒法再揮劍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然......就只是竭盡全力地站著而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換作別人，你受的這些傷早就夠他昏死十次了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這才發現？遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，控制室的爆炸影響了防禦炮，炮台連著這一小塊牆體結構都遭到了嚴重破壞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再不走的話，我們都會摔下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通知所有人，撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個士兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已經擊敗了她，但要擊倒她，卻要再花一些工夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這裡已不值得我搭上這些時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的白狼，你是個可敬的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你還能活著走下這面城牆的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次見面，我會用我的劍為你送去......配得上你的英勇的死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次......"},{"type":"narration","text":"還會有下一次嗎？\n倫蒂尼姆的城牆正在塌陷。\n她也在不斷下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到......你們離開之前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我都沒有倒下。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血液的流失讓她幾乎失去了最後一點知覺。\n但她的身體像是變成了劍與盾的一部分，比鐵還硬，除非被打碎，否則絕不彎折。\n維多利亞打造出來的武器，依舊駐在倫蒂尼姆的城牆上。\n維多利亞磨煉而成的戰士，也會守在倫蒂尼姆的城牆上。\n直到城牆一角砸向倫蒂尼姆的地面——\n她也會回到生養她的土地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這面牆......到底有多高？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我好像......"},{"type":"narration","text":"......在往上飛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，你還能動嗎？快抓住我的手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......沒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我沒死！我運氣好，摔下去的時候抓住了外牆結構，然後又被Misery先生救了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，士兵，你的仗還沒有打完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們啊，就真的不打算讓我休息一會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，你別閉眼睛，別忘了，你的士兵還在這裡！你不能倒下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本，你變得就和......和我的某個隊員一樣吵鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......我從來就拿你們沒辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的視野恢復清晰。\n倫蒂尼姆的城牆還在那裡，雖然最高處多了一個小小的缺口，但看起來依舊巍峨堅硬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這震動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下結構終於被大炮轟塌了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這震動是來自我們腳下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我找到了一條可以走的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這截通道......在往上移動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣，我們在這裡待了這麼長時間，根本就不知道還有這樣的機關啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......總有一些“本地人”，知道的會比其他本地人更多一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它還會不會追上來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也許不是今天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然找到了新的逃跑方向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......難怪，難怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個氣味......是那個菲林散發出來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......所謂王族不過是為了鞏固權位而生造出來的謊言，與這個國家的文明一樣可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算她是那個逃跑的小獅子，她的血液味道也不會和其他菲林有任何差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這個截然不同的味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯知道這件事嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你不會有機會追上去確認的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你是誰。你是那個......特雷西斯身邊的小學徒。就算你的老師站在這裡，他也未必能輕鬆攔下我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他已經沒有資格再當我的老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個咒術的氣息......你也來了嗎，小女妖？我還以為你正在城裡與我的隨從們玩遊戲。"},{"type":"narration","text":"區區學藝不精的施術者，他們還不足以絆住我的腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......這下難辦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這即將坍塌的地下通道可不是什麼王庭聚首的好地方。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他眼裡是不是完全沒有我？就因為我既沒有跟特雷西斯學過本事，也沒什麼高貴的血液嗎？\n這囉哩囉嗦的老頭子真的惹惱了我。我要用一百顆炸彈給他開一個歡送晚會，你們沒意見吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......彙報情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的人從控制室跳了出去，有那個卡特斯在，我們沒辦法成功狙擊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下通道的反抗軍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我們偵測到下面發生了爆炸......大君還沒回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他受了重傷，目前正昏迷不醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚集剩下的人手，一隊人立刻檢查城防系統，彙報損失。我們隨時要做好啟動更多防禦炮......甚至主炮的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人，包圍車站。活下來的反抗軍一定會從那裡走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有......有斥候回報，他們發覺有另一撥人正在迅速靠近車站......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，不要太責怪自己。你已經盡力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎麼來了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，快看城牆方向——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城防炮......被關閉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發信號！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了，大家都上來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是薩卡茲......都在往這裡湧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攔住他們！把他們都殺光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要打退這些薩卡茲，我們就能啟動列車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為你們能輕鬆走掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼另一個方向也有反抗軍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是援軍？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一支隊伍從北面衝破了薩卡茲士兵的封鎖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......他們是誰叫來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們之前派出去向中央城區求援的信使還有活下來的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩迪恩區的朋友們，你們幹得不錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下面的戰鬥，可以讓我們這些更專業的接手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們動起手來......好像要有經驗得多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......那是羅德島幹員？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打散他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打出一條通道，確保自救軍戰士從地下通道安全撤出！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊手，幹掉那幾個通訊兵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，孟塔古小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......孟塔古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救軍戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這名字聽起來好耳熟，是不是什麼上過報紙的貴族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要分心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管他們是什麼身份，我們是站在同一邊的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能通行了！快，領著大家上列車！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倫蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇......海蒂女士，我們上來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我說過的，我們的戰士不會讓我們失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是她的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的信使成功聯絡上了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更確切地說，是你們羅德島的信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達！快看，是達格達！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群中的達格達也看見了她們。\n她拋下了正與她纏鬥的薩卡茲，毫不猶豫地衝到了通道口，朝灰頭土臉的夥伴們伸出了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我很怕自己遲到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你沒有遲到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們來說，你什麼時候回來，都不算遲到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋，你......你走的時候那麼乾脆，我都來不及揍你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......現在揍也不算太晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，維娜，你知道她會回來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們瞞著因陀羅我能理解，不到像這樣的最後關頭，她可能都沒法接受貴族雇傭兵的援手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起埋怨我，先一起把這些敵人解決了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我又沒停下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，我還沒說完......你們起碼告訴我一聲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你們害得我就連在被追殺的時候，都還惦記著達格達會不會又跑到什麼危險的地方，準備著和薩卡茲同歸於盡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，摩根......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以後都不會了。我發誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王小組，全體集合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要等到博士他們回來，我們就能一起離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g14_lightinduarea_railway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我們回來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們居然是從天上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要落地了！大家讓一讓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉、拉住滑索！不要撞壞列車，這是我們唯一的逃生工具！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我抱住博士了，我們沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全落地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我們居然真的回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，洛洛有沒有事？大家都撤出來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活下來的人比我們預想的要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這多虧了你，費斯特，還有你帶來的羅德島的大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......老比爾，你看到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，別想偷懶暈過去！戰鬥還沒結束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還能動就趕緊來動力室幫我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有薩卡茲士兵在追過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們已經沒什麼能做的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們會在這裡擋住他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們一起。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，列車要動了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，我們也上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩沒有回答你。她的身體一動不動，似乎連呼吸都停止了。\n你知道她很震驚。她從未像此刻這樣，不加掩飾地將強烈的情緒展露在幹員們面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"與此同時，追趕著列車的薩卡茲都停下來了。\n他們都轉過頭去，看著同一個方向。\n一個薩卡茲走進了廢墟裡。\n所有的硝煙都像在她腳下消散，所有的弩聲都像在她四周止歇。\n只有風越刮越烈。\n滿地灰燼被吹得紛紛揚揚，一部分沾上了她的衣裙，一部分弄髒了她的白髮。她彷彿並不介意，只是靜靜地注視著一處殘垣。\n那看起來曾經是城防炮的一部分。不知何時飛來了一隻漆黑的羽獸，就站在溫熱的炮口上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可能是被加速的列車驚擾，羽獸抖了抖翅膀。\n有所感應一般，白髮薩卡茲轉過了身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她理應看不見列車上的人，但她的表情卻像認出了看著她的人是誰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的面龐是那樣溫和，她的眼睛裡卻映滿了悲哀。這麼多的悲哀或許並不全部來自她自己，也來自正看著她的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩終於回過頭來。\n她還是沒有回答你，你也並不急著要她回答。\n耳邊響起了羽獸的鳴叫。你看到窗外有一群羽獸飛了起來，先你們一步，衝進了前方的大風裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"列車帶著你們飛速地駛離車站。\n城牆，戰場，以及那個白髮的身影，都被遠遠拋在了後面。\n轟隆。轟隆。轟隆。\n是大腦中炮聲的殘留，是列車與軌道的碰撞，還是不遠處那團陰雲中的雷鳴？\n倫蒂尼姆的中心就在眼前。\n而你們正在駛入這場風暴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]}],"observedOperators":[]}
